// spec/codingTools/fileSession.md, "Story: Protect workspace files against stale edits, accidental overwrites, and secret leaks"; spec/codingTools/fileSession.md, "A device file follows the same read-before-overwrite rule, by content"; spec/codingTools/index.md, "Bounded output projection never exceeds line or byte ceilings and spills to an artifact when truncated"
